          "grammarPointEn": "Mixed review of B2: counterfactual conditionals, wishes, the past subjunctive, impersonal mētawān, the passive across tenses, deduction, advanced relative clauses, concession, tā and simultaneity, register, nominalization, word formation, reported speech and discourse connectors.",
          "slides": [
            {
